# Local environment files — this project doesn't use one (config.py reads
# its two secrets, ADMIN_TOKEN and FLASK_SECRET_KEY, directly from the
# process environment rather than a .env file — see config.py's "Admin"
# section), but this stays as a no-cost safety net in case one is ever
# added locally.
.env

